http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/Zelig/Zelig_3.5.5.tar.gz

Run this:
install.packages("C:/*YOUR PATH*/Zelig_3.5.5.tar.gz", repos = NULL,
type="source")

Best wishes,

Ewen



