It looks like not all the demos from previous Zelig versions have been ported over to Zelig4.

I just modified the "vertci" demo to work in Zelig4 and added it to the Beta version.  You can run this now from:


install.packages("Zelig", type = "source", repos = "http://r.iq.harvard.edu/")

library(Zelig)

demo(vertci)


It's a nice demo of some of the new graphics features of Zelig4, so I'm glad you brought it to my attention.

James

